            "review_title": "Review at Tofu Pudding Covang 107",
            "review_text": "Hung Duong\nDa Nang, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nGood food\nMay 2025 • Couples\nWe had an amazing experience at CoVang! The tofu is fresh, silky, and incredibly flavorful – truly a taste of tradition. The combination of fresh soy milk, ginger, pandan, and sugarcane creates a perfect balance of sweetness and earthiness. What really stood out was the commitment to using natural ingredients, free from preservatives, making it not only delicious but also healthy. The staff was friendly and passionate about sharing the story behind their tofu. Whether you're a health-conscious foodie or simply curious to try a unique local delicacy, CoVang is a must-visit. Highly recommended!\nRead more\nWritten May 27, 2025",
